# Adopt Ipê's prescriptive Live.app `init` signature.
#
# Upstream Sky leaves Live.app's init argument a free type variable, so
# `init : {} -> ( Model, Cmd Msg )` is accepted. Ipê pins the argument to the
# typed opaque LiveReq (Live.app requires `init : LiveReq -> ( Model, Cmd Msg )`),
# a sanctioned make-invalid-states-unrepresentable divergence recorded as B24 in
# docs/divergences-from-sky.md and ADR 0021. The init body ignores the request,
# so the change is signature-only.

[[edit]]
file: src/Main.ipe
find:
"""
init : {  } -> ( Model, Cmd Msg )
"""
replace:
"""
init : LiveReq -> ( Model, Cmd Msg )
"""
